*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*%
*% cmacs Virtual Printer PPD
*% Copyright (C) 2026 Zach Podbielniak
*% SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later
*%
*% Declares the printer as a "raw PDF" passthrough.  CUPS hands the PDF
*% to the cmacs-print backend on stdin without any rasterisation —
*% mirrors how cups-pdf and Microsoft Print to PDF behave on their
*% respective systems.
*%
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CMACSPRT.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "cmacs"
*Product: "(cmacs Virtual Printer)"
*ModelName: "cmacs Virtual Printer"
*ShortNickName: "cmacs"
*NickName: "cmacs Virtual Printer"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:cmacs;MDL:Virtual Printer;CMD:PDF;"

*% Tell CUPS to skip rasterisation: hand application/pdf straight to the
*% backend on stdin.  "0" priority + "-" command means "no filter".
*cupsFilter: "application/pdf 0 -"

*% Standard page sizes (purely informational — the backend doesn't
*% inspect them; the original PDF's page dimensions win).
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Letter
*PageSize Letter/US Letter: ""
*PageSize Legal/US Legal: ""
*PageSize A4/A4: ""
*PageSize A3/A3: ""
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Letter
*PageRegion Letter/US Letter: ""
*PageRegion Legal/US Legal: ""
*PageRegion A4/A4: ""
*PageRegion A3/A3: ""
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: Letter
*ImageableArea Letter/US Letter: "0 0 612 792"
*ImageableArea Legal/US Legal: "0 0 612 1008"
*ImageableArea A4/A4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea A3/A3: "0 0 842 1191"

*DefaultPaperDimension: Letter
*PaperDimension Letter/US Letter: "612 792"
*PaperDimension Legal/US Legal: "612 1008"
*PaperDimension A4/A4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension A3/A3: "842 1191"

*DefaultResolution: 600dpi
*Resolution 600dpi/600 DPI: ""
